WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.425
The storm ended.

2
00:00:05.426 --> 00:00:09.810
Branches and leaves were everywhere.

3
00:00:09.811 --> 00:00:13.921
Everything was wet.

4
00:00:13.922 --> 00:00:19.356
"Now I will fix the roof!" said Pig.

5
00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:33.844
Pig found a hammer.

6
00:00:33.845 --> 00:00:37.409
The nails were up high.

7
00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.918
Pig reached.

8
00:00:39.919 --> 00:00:43.049
The hammer slipped.

9
00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:51.733
"Ouch!" cried Pig.

10
00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:54.851
Pig found the ladder.

11
00:00:54.852 --> 00:00:57.971
"Grr! Umph!"

12
00:00:57.972 --> 00:01:01.311
The ladder was too heavy.

13
00:01:01.312 --> 00:01:05.335
"I can't lift it," said Pig.

14
00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:09.674
Farmer came into the barn.

15
00:01:09.675 --> 00:01:12.058
"Hmm," he said.

16
00:01:12.059 --> 00:01:24.358
"That hole needs to be fixed."

17
00:01:24.359 --> 00:01:28.847
Farmer started to fix the roof.

18
00:01:28.848 --> 00:01:31.289
Pig was sad.

19
00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:35.341
"I wanted to fix the roof," he said.

20
00:01:35.342 --> 00:01:38.955
Dog ran to the barn.

21
00:01:38.956 --> 00:01:42.041
He didn't look happy.

22
00:01:42.042 --> 00:01:44.927
"What's wrong?" said Cow.

23
00:01:44.928 --> 00:01:48.778
"Red Bird is in trouble," said Dog.

24
00:01:48.779 --> 00:01:53.325
"His tree blew over!"

